Package: iARstream
Title: Classical and Bayesian Online Estimation for AR(p) and iAR Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Nicol", "González", email = "nicol.gonmac@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides classical and Bayesian online estimation methods for AR(p) and iAR Models. 
  Classical optimization routines include Online Gradient Descent (OGD) and Online Newton Step (ONS), 
  supporting quadratic, absolute, Huber, and Log-Cosh loss functions. 
  Bayesian approaches include Online Particle Filtering (OPF), supporting Gaussian, Laplace and Student-t 
  error distributions, and Online Bayesian Regression (OBR) under a Gaussian likelihood framework. 
  Designed for sequential parameter updating in streaming and real-time time series analysis.
Imports: 
    S7,
    stats, 
    truncnorm
